# Anything-to-MCP Frontend Configuration
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# Point to the local FastAPI backend (default if not set):
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# - Same-origin deployment (Single Project): Set VITE_API_URL="" (or leave empty)
#   This makes the frontend call /api/* relative to the same origin.
# - Separate backend deployment: Set VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.vercel.app

